<PageTitle>RogueDeck Studio</PageTitle>

<h1>RogueDeck Studio</h1>
<p class="muted">
    Author a whole roguelike as one <strong>run document</strong>, tab by tab: the
    <a href="hero">Hero</a> &amp; starting state, the <a href="cards">Cards</a> &amp; deck, the
    <a href="encounters">Encounters</a> (enemies), <a href="relics">Relics</a>, and
    <a href="events">Events</a>. Every tab is a lens over the same document.
</p>
<p class="muted">
    Then play it: <a href="playtest">Playtest</a> a single encounter straight from the document, or assemble the
    map and drive or balance the whole thing in the <a href="run">Run</a> tab.
</p>
